	chamber completion bash > /etc/bash_completion.d/chamber

#### macOS:

	chamber completion bash > $(brew --prefix)/etc/bash_completion.d/chamber

You will need to start a new shell for this setup to take effect.`,
		RunE: func(cmd *cobra.Command, args []string) error {
